  "instructions": [
    "Heat milk in a saucepan and stir in sugar until dissolved.",
    "Add cream of coconut, ginger paste, and vanilla essence. Bring to a simmer and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Meanwhile, whisk egg yolks with baking powder until smooth.",
    "Gradually add hot milk mixture into the yolk mixture while continuously whisking.",
    "Transfer the mixture back to the saucepan and heat gently until it starts to thicken but not boiling.",
    "Divide the creme patissiere evenly among bilo-bilo and serve in a talavera plate."
